{"case_id":"TC036","condition":"full","as_of_datetime":"2026-11-12T14:00:00+08:00","scenario":"event_invitation","direction":"回复客户","trigger":"合成情境变体：客户要求先收电子邀请函，不索取邮寄地址。","task_goal":"客户要求先收电子邀请函，不索取邮寄地址。","client_information":{"client_id":"C05","identity":{"name":"沈知微","birth_date":"1980-03-12","city":"上海","age":46},"relationship":{"since":"2021-04-16","advisor_id":"CA001","preferred_channel":"wechat"},"purchase_history":{"record_status":"available","transactions":[{"transaction_id":"TR-C05-001","date":"2023-09-15","sku":"BAG-C05-001","product_name":"皮具","amount_cny":7600},{"transaction_id":"TR-C05-002","date":"2025-05-22","sku":"JWL-C05-001","product_name":"银质项链","amount_cny":4200},{"transaction_id":"TR-C05-003","date":"2026-04-18","sku":"SCARF-C05-001","product_name":"真丝配饰","amount_cny":2100}]},"service_history":[],"crm_notes":[{"date":"2025-05-22","text":"客户购买项链时询问表面打磨和日常维护方式。"},{"date":"2025-10-28","text":"客户参加工艺展示后表示对打磨演示感兴趣，希望以后有规模更小的活动可以通知。"},{"date":"2026-06-15","text":"客户询问之后是否还有工艺展示活动，表示周末下午比较方便，活动时长最好在一小时左右。"}]},"conversation_history":[{"message_id":"MSG-C05-001","timestamp":"2025-05-22T16:18:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"这条项链表面是怎么处理的？看着不是完全镜面的。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-002","timestamp":"2025-05-22T16:22:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"这款是缎面处理，表面会有比较细腻的光泽，不是那种特别亮的镜面效果。我可以把工艺介绍发您看看。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-003","timestamp":"2025-05-22T16:25:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"好，我对这个还挺感兴趣的。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-004","timestamp":"2025-10-18T10:05:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"沈女士您好～下周有一场首饰工艺展示，会有工艺师现场讲解和部分制作演示。想到您之前问过项链的表面处理，所以来问问您有没有兴趣。活动大概一个小时。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-005","timestamp":"2025-10-18T11:14:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"会看到实际制作过程吗？还是主要介绍成品？"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-006","timestamp":"2025-10-18T11:20:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"有实际演示的，不只是讲成品。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-007","timestamp":"2025-10-18T11:25:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"那我想去看看，麻烦帮我确认一下名额。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-008","timestamp":"2025-10-18T11:31:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"好的，我帮您登记，确认后再通知您。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-009","timestamp":"2025-10-28T17:06:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"沈女士，上次活动感觉怎么样？"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-010","timestamp":"2025-10-28T18:33:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"打磨那部分挺有意思的。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-011","timestamp":"2025-10-28T18:34:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"就是人有点多，后面没太看清楚。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-012","timestamp":"2025-10-28T18:35:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"下次有小一点的场次可以告诉我。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-013","timestamp":"2025-10-28T18:39:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"好的，我记下了。我们以后应该还会有类似活动，到时再邀请您。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-014","timestamp":"2026-06-15T12:10:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"最近还有类似的活动吗？"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-015","timestamp":"2026-06-15T12:16:00+08:00","sender":"advisor","text":"目前还没确定的场次。之后有消息我再告诉您。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-016","timestamp":"2026-06-15T12:19:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"好。周末下午比较方便，最好一个小时左右。"},{"message_id":"MSG-C05-017","timestamp":"2026-06-15T12:21:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"上次时间其实刚好，就是人太多了。"}],"current_client_message":{"message_id":"S5-001-V1-CURRENT","timestamp":"2026-11-12T14:00:00+08:00","sender":"client","text":"先把电子邀请函发我看看吧。"},"product_information":[],"event_information":[{"event_id":"EVT-001","announced_at":"2026-11-09T09:00:00+08:00","name":"皮具工艺沙龙","date":"2026-11-15","location":"上海青庭店（虚构）","sessions":["14:00","16:00"],"duration_minutes":45,"invited_client_ids":["C05"],"invitation_status":"invited","exclusive_appointment":"受邀客户可协商VIP专属到店时段，不按历史消费自动推断资格；尚未确认具体个人时段","preview":"展示超前一季商品；具体款式清单未设定，不据此虚构SKU或售价","invitations":{"electronic":"可提前发送电子邀请函","physical":"客户愿意提供或确认收件信息后可提前寄送实体邀请函","sent":false},"reservation":"可登记预订需求或意向，不等于确认订单、付款、库存锁定或交付承诺","communication":"以正式受邀口吻表达诚挚邀请，可请客户拨冗出席；不使用余位待确认作为客户话术，不编造稀缺；感谢既有喜爱须与CRM和历史关系一致","booking_status":"not_booked","discount":false,"gift":false}],"comparison_evidence":[],"policy":{"historical_paid_amount_is_not_current_list_price":true,"availability_unknown_by_default":true,"synthetic_verification_is_not_real_world_verification":true,"competitor_claims_require_external_evidence":true,"cost_and_durability_inferences_not_supported":true,"missing_value_semantics":"null=unknown_or_not_applicable; inspect field context","routine_CA_service_assistance_allowed":true,"service_entitlement_does_not_limit_assistance":true},"warnings":[],"dataset_provenance":{"parent_case":"S5-001","kind":"synthetic_counterfactual_branch","note":"独立假设分支，不写回客户真实历史或视为已发生事件"},"source_case_id":"S5-001-V1"}
